  "term": "collaborative learning",
  "definition": "Collaborative learning is learning that takes place through learners working and interacting together rather than learning entirely alone. In the packet, it is described as supporting cognitive, social, and emotional development, while also being vulnerable to problems such as unequal participation and free-riding.",
